\par \pard\tx355 \{bmc bm20.bmp\}\tab \b Limits\plain\fs24 : A virtually noiseless image is required because Auto Focus evaluates the image contrast. 
\par \tab For coarse focusing the structures must be coarse enough to find the focus.
\par \tab Astigmatism must be corrected and the aperture centered.
\par 
