\pard\keepn \b\fs36\cf1 Coarse/Fine State
\par \pard\tx355 \plain\fs24 
\par When adjusting parameters with the mouse  the increments may be \b coarse\plain\fs24  or \b fine\plain\fs24 . The current state of the coarse/fine flag is indicated in the \uldb \b Status Bar\plain\b\fs24 {\v Status_Bar}\plain\fs24 .
\par 
\par Fine\tab \tab \{bmc bm31.bmp\}
\par 
\par Coarse\tab \{bmc bm32.bmp\}
\par The state may be toggled using the \b <TAB> \plain\fs24 key \{bmc bm33.bmp\}.
