\par \trowd\trgaph105\trleft-116 \cellx6795\cellx10985\pard\intbl\tx355 A parallel interface port is provided on the back panel labeled LPT1 for a Line Printer and equivalent equipment.
\par\intbl The standard pin configuration is as follows:
