\par \pard\tx355 \plain\fs24 
\par If you want to set the specimen surface to a specific working distance, \uldb \b adjust the focus\plain\b\fs24 {\v Focusing_on_the_Specimen}\plain\fs24  and watch the \ul Working Distance\plain\fs24 {\v Working_Distance} Readout \{bmc bm65.bmp\}  on the \uldb \b Status Bar\plain\b\fs24 {\v Status_Bar}\plain\fs24 .
\par 
\par \{bmc bm17.bmp\}\tab For fixed values you may also \ul click\plain\fs24 {\v Click} on the WD Readout in the Status Bar and enter the value directly in the Parameter Entry Window. 
\par 
\par See also \uldb \b Parameter Control Analogue\plain\b\fs24 {\v Parameter_Control_Analogue}\plain\fs24 .
\par 
\par The image will get out of focus.
\par 
