\par \trowd\trgaph105\trleft-116 \cellx7935\cellx12115\pard\intbl This panel allows the \uldb \b Dynamic Focus\plain\b\fs24 {\v Dynamic_Focus}\plain\fs24  function (or \b F\plain\fs24 rame \b C\plain\fs24 orrected 
\par\intbl \b F\plain\fs24 ocus) to be controlled to bring the extremes of an image of a tilted specimen into focus.
\par\intbl 
\par\intbl This panel also contains the controls for \uldb \b Scan Rotation\plain\b\fs24 {\v Scan_Rotation}\plain\fs24  and
\par\intbl \uldb \b Tilt Correction\plain\b\fs24 {\v Tilt_Correction}\plain\fs24 .
\par\intbl 
\par\intbl \b Scan Rotation\plain\fs24  rotates the scan on the specimen which rotates the image around the center of the\uldb \b  Image Window\plain\b\fs24 {\v Image_Window}\plain\fs24 .
\par\intbl 
\par\intbl \b Tilt Correction\plain\fs24  corrects for the foreshortening effect of highly tilted specimens.
