\par \pard \plain\fs24 
\par There are three control buttons on the \uldb \b Computer Housing\plain\b\fs24 {\v Computer_Housing}\plain\fs24   which start the instrument , close down the instrument and perform an emergency shut down.
\par 
\par \trowd\trgaph105\trleft-116 \cellx6795\cellx11555\pard\intbl \b (1) \plain\fs24 The green button is the \b Start Up Button\plain\fs24  (1) used when in Standby mode to switch power to the computer
\par\intbl 
\par\intbl \b (2)\plain\fs24  The middle button is the \b Standby Button\plain\fs24 ,the \uldb \b computer is powered down\plain\b\fs24 {\v Instrument_Shut_down}\plain\fs24 .
\par\intbl 
\par\intbl \b (3) \plain\fs24 The red button is the \b Emergency Button,\plain\fs24  and it executes an \uldb \b Emergency Shut-down\plain\b\fs24 {\v Emergency_Shut_down}\plain\fs24 . The software is forced to terminate immediately, the computer and the instrument electronics are switched off and the vacuum system is stopped.\cell\pard \pard\intbl   
