\par \plain\fs24 The Display LUT converts the 8 bit image store contents to a Red, Green, Blue signal for display on the Display Monitor.
\par The Display LUT may be set by one of the following functions:
\par \pard\tx355 \tab 1. The \uldb \b Display LUT\plain\b\fs24 {\v GD50DR@LutMgr.HLP}\plain\fs24  Window.
