\par \pard\tx355 \{bmc bm1.bmp\}\tab Press the Windows95 \{bmc bm111.bmp\} key and navigate \b (\uldb Cursor Movement Keys\plain\b\fs24 {\v Cursor_Movement_Keys}\plain\fs24 ) to \b Program Files \plain\fs24 to\b  LEO 32 \plain\fs24 to\b  SEM User Interface \plain\fs24 and press\b  <ENTER>
