\par \trowd\trgaph105\trleft-116 \cellx6795\cellx11265\pard\intbl The program is started. 
\par\intbl 
\par\intbl To enter the program you must insert your name and password which was supplied by your systems administrator.
\par\intbl 
\par\intbl You may also sign up as GUEST with no password.
\par\intbl \par\pard \pard\intbl\li355\fi-355\tx355 \{bmc bm3.bmp\}\tab Click in the text field for \b User Name\plain\fs24  and enter your name. Change to \b Password\plain\fs24  with the tab key \{bmc bm33.bmp\} and enter the password. Since it is hidden, only **** are displayed. 
\par\intbl 
\par\intbl \{bmc bm3.bmp\}\tab Terminate with \b <ENTER> \plain\fs24 or click on the \b OK \plain\fs24 button.\par\pard \pard\intbl \cell\pard \pard\intbl 
\par\intbl 
\par\intbl 
\par\intbl      \{bmc bm197.bmp\}\cell\intbl\row
