\par\intbl 
\par\intbl \{bmc bm3.bmp\}\tab Pick up and \ul drag\plain\fs24 {\v Drag} the red point.
\par\intbl \b or\plain\fs24 
\par\intbl \{bmc bm3.bmp\}\tab Use the \ul scroll bars\plain\fs24 {\v Scroll_Bar} to adjust x/y.
\par\intbl 
\par\intbl \{bmc bm3.bmp\}\tab Observe the image for lowest astigmatism.\par\pard \pard\intbl\tx355 \par\pard \pard\intbl\tx355 \{bmc bm17.bmp\}\tab The mouse is also active in the \uldb \b image window\plain\b\fs24 {\v Image_Window}\plain\fs24  for stigmation.
