\par\intbl 
\par\intbl \{bmc bm3.bmp\}\tab Close and leave panel, click on \{bmc bm104.bmp\} .\par\pard \pard\intbl \cell\pard \pard\intbl      \{bmc bm208.bmp\}
\par\intbl 
\par\intbl 
\par\intbl For further information about parameter adjustment refer to
\par\intbl \uldb \b Navigation Box\plain\b\fs24 {\v Navigation_Box}\plain\fs24 \cell\intbl\row
\pard\tx355 \b Auto Stig\plain\fs24  initiates the \uldb \b Auto Astigmatism Correction\plain\b\fs24 {\v 52QGYW}\plain\fs24  routine.
