\par \pard\tx355 
\par \pard\tx355 \{bmc bm24.bmp\}\tab \b Note: \plain\fs24 Only when the operating vacuum is obtained can the high voltage be activated. The high voltage is switched off automatically when the chamber is ventilated (safety interlock). The high voltage is also switched off with poor vacuum in the gun.
\par 
\par \{bmc bm0.bmp\}\tab \ul Click\plain\fs24 {\v Click} on \b Beam\plain\fs24  in the \uldb \b Menu Bar\plain\b\fs24 {\v Menu_Bar}\plain\fs24 , then select \uldb \b Beam On\plain\b\fs24 {\v Menu_Beam_Beam_On}\plain\fs24 .\b  \plain\fs24 Runs up gun and EHT ON automatically.
\par 
\par \{bmc bm1.bmp\}\tab \b Type <ALT + B>\plain\fs24  then \b <O>\plain\fs24 . Runs up gun and EHT ON automatically.
\par \pard\tx355 
\par \{bmc bm17.bmp\}\tab Click on \b Gun / EHT\plain\fs24 . in the \uldb \b Status Bar\plain\b\fs24 {\v Status_Bar}\plain\fs24  and then on \b Beam On \plain\fs24 
\par 
\par \{bmc bm1.bmp\}\tab Type \b <Ctrl + G>\plain\fs24  to display the SEM Control dialog, select the \uldb \b SEM Control Gun\plain\b\fs24 {\v 5_0HOO@TabMgr.hlp}\plain\fs24  tab.
\par 
\par \tab From the \b Beam State\plain\fs24  \ul Drop-down List\plain\fs24 {\v Drop_down_List} select \b EHT On.
\par \plain\fs24 
