\pard\keepn \fs36\cf1 System Keys
\par \pard \plain\fs24 
\par The following keys can be used from any window, regardless of the application you are using.\b 
\par \plain\fs24 
\par \pard\li2605\fi-2605\tx2605 \b Key(s)\tab Function\plain\fs24 
\par \b 
\par <CTRL + ESC>\plain\fs24 \tab Switches to the Task List.
\par 
\par \b <ALT + ESC>\plain\fs24 \tab Switches to the next application window or minimized icon, including full-screen programs.
\par 
\par \b <ALT + TAB>\plain\fs24 \tab Switches to the next application window, restoring applications that are running as icons.
\par 
\par \b <ALT + PrtScr>\plain\fs24 \tab Copies the entire screen to the Clipboard.
\par 
\par \b <CTRL + F4>\plain\fs24 \tab Closes the active window.
\par 
\par \b <F1>\plain\fs24 \tab Gets Help and displays the Help Topic for the application. 
\par \pard\li2605\fi-2605\tx2605 \tab (See \uldb \b Help Keys\plain\b\fs24 {\v Help_Keys}\plain\fs24 )\b 
\par \page
{\up $}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up $} System Management}
{\up #}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up #} System_Management}
{\up >}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up >} main}
\pard\keepn \fs36\cf1 System Management
\par \pard\tx355 \plain\fs24 
\par Creation of User accounts and profiles are performed using the \uldb \b Administrator\plain\b\fs24 {\v Contents@admin32.hlp}
\par 
\par Disk Management
\par \plain\fs24 Regularly back up the following (at least once per month)
\par \{bmc bm3.bmp\}\tab \'5cPROGRAM FILES\'5cLEO\'5cLEO32\'5cSYSTEM\'5cLEO_USER.*
\par \{bmc bm3.bmp\}\tab \'5cLEO\'5c*.*
\par \{bmc bm3.bmp\}\tab Any directories containing results of work (e.g. image directories)
\par \{bmc bm3.bmp\}\tab User directories containing customised macros, toolbars etc.
\par \{bmc bm3.bmp\}\tab If User Accounting is in use the \uldb accounting database\plain\fs24 {\v CKUK25@admin32.hlp} must be backed up 
\par \pard\tx355 
\par Regularly run Scan Disk (See Windows User Manual)
\par 
\par Periodically \ul Compact the User Database\plain\fs24 {\v 4FMQ7H@admin32.hlp} and,if user accounting is enabled, \ul Compact the Accounting Database\plain\fs24 {\v 37J003V@admin32.hlp}
\par 
\par If experiencing problems with user or accounting databases see \ul Repair User Database\plain\fs24 {\v 1AZ3ZX.@admin32.hlp} and \ul Repair Accounting Database\plain\fs24 {\v I35BR2@admin32.hlp}
\par 
\par \b Disk Space\plain\fs24 
\par You will be warned if disk space drops to unacceptable levels, if this happens archive and/or delete any unwanted temporary data.
\par \pard\tx355 If neccessary archive and delete the \uldb \b Leo Log file\plain\b\fs24 {\v 1MC7UIQ@admin32.hlp}\plain\fs24 
\par \page
